{"id": "5cb85685-648f-4fb1-a85d-2b9732282f07", "slug": "task-management", "title": "Task Management", "description": "Task Management Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Task Management\"\ndescription: \"Task Management Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF8A8A\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#8AFFB1\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#3A1D1D\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Task Management\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 17; favorites: 5; remixes: 5.\nTags: testimonial, section, animated, bento, social-proof.\n## Overview\nTask Management Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nWorkspaces Bring clarity to — your daily flow. Capture objectives, assign responsibilities, and track momentum. A streamlined, distraction-free environment built for high-performing teams. Initiatives Product Launch - Q…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Bring clarity to — your daily flow.; Marketing Site Redesign; Database Migration Strategy; User Interview Synthesis.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF8A8A, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #8AFFB1, background #FFFFFF, surface #3A1D1D, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Task Management</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital@1&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['\"Playfair Display\"', 'serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        background: '#050505',\n                        surface: '#121212',\n                        border: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.08)',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-background text-white min-h-screen overflow-hidden font-sans relative selection:bg-white/20\">\n\n    <!-- Particle Canvas Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"particle-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Simulated Light Beam -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-[-10%] right-[10%] w-[60vw] h-[120vh] pointer-events-none z-0\"\n         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%); transform: rotate(-35deg); filter: blur(80px); transform-origin: top center;\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"absolute top-[-5%] right-[20%] w-[30vw] h-[100vh] pointer-events-none z-0\"\n         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%); transform: rotate(-35deg); filter: blur(40px); transform-origin: top center;\">\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Layout -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-24 min-h-screen flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12 lg:gap-0 py-24 lg:py-0\">\n\n        <!-- Left Column: Copy -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-5/12 flex flex-col items-start pt-12 lg:pt-0 z-20\">\n            <!-- Badge -->\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-sm mb-8\"\n                 style=\"box-shadow: 0 4px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-add-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-white/70\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/80 tracking-wide uppercase\">Workspaces</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-white mb-6\">\n                Bring clarity to <br/>\n                <span class=\"font-serif italic font-normal text-white/90\">— your daily flow.</span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline -->\n            <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-white/50 max-w-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">\n                Capture objectives, assign responsibilities, and track momentum. A streamlined, distraction-free environment built for high-performing teams.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column: 3D UI Composition -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-7/12 relative h-[500px] sm:h-[600px] lg:h-[800px] flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n\n            <!-- 3D Transform Group -->\n            <div id=\"scene-container\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-[600px] aspect-square\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateY(-18deg) rotateX(12deg) rotateZ(4deg);\">\n\n                <!-- Background Dashboard Layer -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-[#0a0a0a]/80 backdrop-blur-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\"\n                     style=\"transform: translateZ(-100px) scale(1.1); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05), 0 24px 48px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n\n                    <!-- Faded Header -->\n                    <div class=\"h-16 border-b border-border flex items-center px-6 gap-4 opacity-40\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50\">Initiatives</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"12\" class=\"text-white/30\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/50\">Product Launch - Q4</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Faded Content Area -->\n                    <div class=\"p-6 opacity-30 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            Marketing Site Redesign <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:link-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-white/50\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </h2>\n\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8\">\n                            <!-- Faded Column -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/70\">Backlog</span>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-white/50\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"h-32 rounded-xl border border-border bg-white/[0.02]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"h-24 rounded-xl border border-border bg-white/[0.02]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                             <!-- Faded Column -->\n                             <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/70\">Review</span>\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-white/50\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"h-24 rounded-xl border border-border bg-white/[0.02]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Foreground Cards -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6\" style=\"transform: translateZ(50px);\">\n\n                    <!-- Card 1: In Progress -->\n                    <div id=\"card-1\" class=\"w-[90%] sm:w-[420px] rounded-2xl bg-[#141414]/90 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-border p-1\"\n                         style=\"box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1); transform: translateX(20px) translateY(-30px);\">\n\n                        <!-- Card Header -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b border-white/[0.04]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white/80\">Active Phase</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white/40\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Card Body -->\n                        <div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                            <!-- Meta Row -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#3A1D1D] text-[#FF8A8A] text-[10px] font-medium tracking-wide\">\n                                    Urgent\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-white/[0.05] bg-white/[0.02] text-xs text-white/60\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    Dec 12, 2024\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Content -->\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"text-base text-white font-medium mb-1.5 tracking-tight\">Database Migration Strategy</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed font-light line-clamp-2\">\n                                    Outline the steps required to migrate the legacy user database to the new PostgreSQL cluster with zero downtime.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Progress -->\n                            <div class=\"mt-2\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-1 bg-white/10 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-white/40 to-white/80 rounded-full w-3/4\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Footer -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-1 pt-4 border-t border-white/[0.04]\">\n                                <!-- Avatars -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center -space-x-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-2 border-[#141414] bg-neutral-700 flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/80\">JD</div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-2 border-[#141414] bg-neutral-600 flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/80\">AL</div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-2 border-[#141414] bg-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/50\">+3</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Stats -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white/40 text-xs\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:paperclip-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span>4</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-line-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span>12</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 2: Secondary Task -->\n                    <div id=\"card-2\" class=\"w-[90%] sm:w-[420px] rounded-2xl bg-[#141414]/90 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-border p-1\"\n                         style=\"box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05); transform: translateX(-30px) translateY(10px);\">\n\n                        <div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                             <!-- Header Right Action -->\n                             <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 text-white/30\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Meta Row -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#1D3A24] text-[#8AFFB1] text-[10px] font-medium tracking-wide\">\n                                    Normal\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-white/[0.05] bg-white/[0.02] text-xs text-white/60\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    Jan 05, 2025\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Content -->\n                            <div class=\"pr-6\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-base text-white font-medium mb-1.5 tracking-tight\">User Interview Synthesis</h3>\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed font-light line-clamp-2\">\n                                    Collate findings from the recent batch of enterprise customer interviews to identify feature gaps.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Progress -->\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-1 bg-white/10 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-white/40 to-white/80 rounded-full w-[30%]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-white/40 whitespace-nowrap\">2 / 7</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Footer -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-1 pt-4 border-t border-white/[0.04]\">\n                                <!-- Avatars -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center -space-x-2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-2 border-[#141414] bg-neutral-600 flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-white/80\">MK</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Stats -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white/40 text-xs\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:paperclip-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span>1</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-line-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <span>3</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Interactive & Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        // --- Particle System (WebGL simulation) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('particle-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n\n        class Particle {\n            constructor() {\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                this.size = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n                this.speedX = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3;\n                this.speedY = -Math.random() * 0.5 - 0.1;\n                this.opacity = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1;\n            }\n            update() {\n                this.x += this.speedX;\n                this.y += this.speedY;\n                if (this.y < 0) {\n                    this.y = height;\n                    this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                }\n                if (this.x < 0 || this.x > width) {\n                    this.speedX *= -1;\n                }\n            }\n            draw() {\n                ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${this.opacity})`;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initParticles() {\n            particles = [];\n            for (let i = 0; i < 150; i++) {\n                particles.push(new Particle());\n            }\n        }\n\n        function animateParticles() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            particles.forEach(p => {\n                p.update();\n                p.draw();\n            });\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateParticles);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => { resize(); initParticles(); });\n        resize();\n        initParticles();\n        animateParticles();\n\n        // --- Smooth Floating Animation for 3D Scene ---\n        const scene = document.getElementById('scene-container');\n        const card1 = document.getElementById('card-1');\n        const card2 = document.getElementById('card-2');\n        let time = 0;\n\n        function animateScene() {\n            time += 0.01;\n\n            // Subtle container rotation\n            const rotY = -18 + Math.sin(time) * 2;\n            const rotX = 12 + Math.cos(time * 0.8) * 1.5;\n            scene.style.transform = `rotateY(${rotY}deg) rotateX(${rotX}deg) rotateZ(4deg)`;\n\n            // Independent card floating\n            const c1Y = -30 + Math.sin(time * 1.5) * 8;\n            card1.style.transform = `translateX(20px) translateY(${c1Y}px)`;\n\n            const c2Y = 10 + Math.cos(time * 1.2) * 6;\n            card2.style.transform = `translateX(-30px) translateY(${c2Y}px)`;\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateScene);\n        }\n\n        animateScene();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "task-management.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/task-management.jpg", "source_name": "task-management-DESIGN.md", "views": 115, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T18:40:12.739209+00:00"}